"In order to integrate the big tiger back into Cambodia, the Ministry of Environment is cooperating with the WA in the Cardamom Mountains to examine the appropriate location for the return of the big tiger back to the wild, in collaboration with the big tiger from India because the country This is rich in big tigers. This is an additional highlight of Mr. Net Pheaktra.
