Mr. Prum Samkhan stated that the Council has the role of managing the necessary tasks to achieve the goal of promoting and sustaining democratic development, as well as to fulfill the duties delegated by law.
In the third year of the third term of the Chamkar Mon District Council, the Khan Council has performed its mandatory functions in accordance with the Royal Decree, Sub-Decree and the guidelines of the National Committee for Democratic Development at the sub-national level and the Ministry of Interior. Surface.
