(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate of Cambodia, sent a message congratulating Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the occasion of his 70th and 71st birthday on August 5, 2022.
In the message, Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey, on behalf of the members of the Senate and on his own behalf, expressed his deepest congratulations to Samdech Techo, wishing him a long life, well-being and strength.
