Samdech added that the great heroism of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo has always made the Cambodian people remember and be grateful to be able to revive the country with honor and dignity, the people live in dignity and honor. Peace under the shadow of peace.
Once again, Samdech would like to raise his hand to pray for the merits of the three jewels, all the sacred objects in the world of Rithi Barami, the mighty guardian deity of the territory of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, as well as sons, daughters, grandsons and granddaughters, please be blessed with the four precious blessings of the Buddha: age, class, happiness, and strength forever.
