Comment: US House Speaker's visit to Taiwan is clearly provocative
(Phnom Penh): Analysts in Cambodia consider the recent attempt by US Speaker of the US House of Representatives Pelosi to visit Taiwan to be a malicious intent, leading to harassment in the region. And the universe.
"China and the United States have a great responsibility to maintain peace. Both countries have a lot of work to do to maintain stability, food security, energy, industry and the global supply chain," he said. "Thus, any provocative behavior must be avoided so that the world does not fall into the flames of war."
In this regard, Mr. Chea Chanboribo, a social analyst in Cambodia, praised China's high tolerance of non-use of weapons on August 2 at 9:20 a.m. on the plane of Speaker Pelosi. US lawmaker arrives in Taiwan
He believes that Ms. Pelosi's visit can reflect two points: First, it is seen that adherence to the one-China principle of the United States is equal to shaking hands, and second, the world sees and values High on China, who was very patient at the event. However, Mr. Chea Chanboribo considered that the trip of Ms. Pelosi, Speaker of the US House of Representatives to Taiwan is seen that the United States is not honest.
He praised China. Although Pelosi still managed to reach Taiwan, China maintained its patience as a safeguard for global security and global development.
Dr. Chea Monirith called Pelosi a global instigator of global insecurity, a threat to global security, and China as a peacekeeper by standing shoulder to shoulder with countries, including the United States. The United States also adheres to the UN Charter, respects global order and participates in world peacekeeping.
At the same time, he emphasized that the arrival of Ms. Pelosi in Taiwan was a clear and unequivocal sign of America's ambitions and ambitions, which often provoke problems and ignite wars, especially in terms of security. Destroy disrespectful order, ignore UN Charter and trample on this one-China agreement.
The President of the Cambodia-China Association of Progress Researchers considers the principle of the Common Destiny Community of Mankind to remain a priority for China in maintaining peace for the region and the world, despite the visit of the US House of Representatives to the United States. Taiwan is aggressively disrespecting China's sovereignty and territorial integrity.
In conclusion, in order for the world to escape the flames of war and other crises, only all states and superpowers can work together to solve problems peacefully, respect the sovereignty, territorial integrity of each country, respect the UN Charter. Only then can the world be completely peaceful and its people be able to live in peace and development in all fields.
