(Phnom Penh): The humanitarian donations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross through Mr. Khuong Sreng, President of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Phnom Penh were handed over to the people. 40 poor families and elderly people in Sangkat Toul Tum Poung II, Phsar Dem Thkov, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh.
The humanitarian donation ceremony was held this morning, August 3, 2022, in the presence of Mr. Theng Sothol, President of the Cambodian Red Cross Sub-Branch, Chamkar Mon District, and Mr. Prum Samkhan, Honorary President of the Sub-Branch, with the participation of Mrs. Deputy Governor, Director. Deputy Director of Khan Administration, Mr. and Mrs. Chairman-Deputy Chief of Khan Office, Sangkat Phsar Doeum Thkov Administration and relevant officials.
