He continued that the Cambodian Red Cross, headed by Samdech Kittipritthbandit, has always taken care of the well-being of the people in all circumstances and everywhere, regardless of political affiliation, race or color. Where there are difficulties, there is the Cambodian Red Cross.
Mr. Theng Sothol said that people, the elderly, the disabled are considered vulnerable and also need to be rescued immediately to receive gifts now to solve daily life.
In addition, the Chairman of the Sub-Branch Committee would like to call on all people to be more careful, please continue to strictly implement the measures of the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, "3 protect and 3 do not" to participate in prevention and protection. Outbreaks appear to be exacerbated during pregnancy and in children.
