It should be reminded that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, also recommended to increase the attraction of domestic tourists and tourists from neighboring countries and regions, because in the Kovid 19 stage, only domestic tourists and tourists from Neighboring countries, which are more likely to visit Cambodia, bring some income back to the people.
