(Phnom Penh): Recently, there has been a lot of discussion on social media about compulsory car insurance, with people expressing different opinions, even though they have not yet received all the information, some of which have been raised. Compulsory motor insurance is a new burden for people who have to spend money.
However, the official who is the operator on this work came out to explain that compulsory vehicle insurance is not a burden on the people, instead compulsory vehicle insurance is a policy to protect financial security in society for Individuals involved in traffic on public roads and are enforced in almost every country in the world.
Mr. Bou Chanphirou, Director General of the Insurance Regulator of Cambodia, in the press conference of the Royal Government Spokesperson Unit this morning, August 2, 2022, under the theme "Achievements for 5 years of the Ministry of Economy and Finance" claimed. Using this insurance service is like saving money to use when there is a risk.
Mr. Bou Chanpirou gave an example that the current use of insurance services has not been fully disclosed, showing two aspects, namely: the victim did not receive any compensation in the event of an accident and second: the perpetrator Try to escape from its responsibilities. As the report shows, Cambodia loses about $ 300 million annually due to traffic accidents
"There is a misconception that obligations are a burden If everyone has absolute insurance, the victims will be automatically reimbursed from the accident," he said. Insurance companies. In particular, the provocateur is not worried about running away because there is someone to help pay instead. "Insurance is like saving money for a risk that arises at some point, so it is not a burden."
According to the Director General of the Cambodian Insurance Regulator, the insurance law has been in place since 2014, but the Royal Government has not yet implemented it. From luxury cars to bulldozers, so there must be a clear division before implementation.
However, the Ministry has also explained that the vehicle insurance will provide the vehicle owner with the responsibility for the payment of compensation to the victim, insurance (for example + compensation for the treatment of injuries of the victim caused by the vehicle. Reasons, etc.).
This is a mechanism for risk transfer of vehicle owners to alleviate the financial burden in traffic accidents, especially for victims. If the car owner does not have insurance, all expenses or damage will have to use their savings and may even lead to further borrowing, which aggravates the family economic burden.
Purchasing car insurance should not be viewed in a negative light as a huge expense, but as a personal financial plan for accident prevention.
