(Phnom Penh): A senior official of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, as well as a senior official of the National Police, came out to confirm that the vehicle owner can bring a copy for the vehicle identification card and vehicle technical inspection certificate (check). But the driver's license can not use a copy, must use the original.
The approval of the senior official of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport and the senior official of the National Police came after many vehicle owners reacted to the requirement to bring the original for vehicle identification. Vehicle technical inspection certificate as well as driver's license.
A senior official of the two institutions told Fresh News on condition of anonymity that according to the law and the sub-decree on road traffic, the original copy is required for the above three documents. However, considering some of the obstacles of the vehicle owners, the traffic police force has favored the vehicle identification card and the vehicle technical inspection certificate can use a copy.
At the same time, the relevant ministries will also review the amendments to the relevant laws and sub-decrees, because law enforcement officials can not implement anything contrary to the law.
However, for a driver's license, it is not possible to use a copy, it is necessary to use the original.
