Samdech Techo praised Vietnam's effective management of 19 Kovid. At the same time, Samdech Techo Prime Minister praised the transformation of the border area, which used to be an insecure area into a border area of peace, cooperation and development, tourism, education, culture, especially people-to-people travel. Of both countries.
Regarding the cooperation between the two countries' friendship associations, Ms. Nguyen Thi Thanh informed Samdech Techo that the two associations had signed a memorandum of understanding to expand the activities of the two countries in advance and enhance the relations between the two countries. Two, especially between people and people.
