US delegation meets with Singapore's top leaders, reaffirming good and comprehensive partnership
The two sides reaffirmed the good and long-standing partnership between Singapore and the United States, the Singapore Foreign Ministry (MFA) said in a statement.
"They discussed the close educational and people-to-people relationship between the two countries and welcomed the renewal and further expansion of bilateral cooperation in the region, such as climate change," the MFA said. .
The two sides also exchanged views on ways to promote stronger social ties in Singapore and the United States.
