Samdech considers this a great loss to one of the great leaders of the Philippines and a good friend of Cambodia who has supported Cambodia's membership in ASEAN.
Through this message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that "His Excellency Fidel Valdes Ramos, who has dedicated his life to the cause of peace, development and prosperity of the Philippines and the region, will always be remembered as a great statesman."
