(Preah Sihanouk): Recently, the land in the community is located in Village 1, Tumnup Rolok Commune, Stung Hav District, Preah Sihanouk Province in Prek 3 area, a flooded forest area and also an important habitat for fish. Strongly protested, with cases of crooks stealing land and deleting it into private property, which in turn affected a series of fish deaths that people raised nearby.
