(Phnom Penh): Khmer civilization expert Mr. Rath Sandab said that in terms of the 10th amendment to the Constitution, which our great National Assembly has already discussed and approved in the meeting on July 28, 2022. Where Cambodians, both inside and outside the country, rejoice is the end of the history page of a leader with a false nationalism in serving the motherland and the people.
Because when it comes to the amendment of the Constitution, especially the new Article 119 (a) clearly states that "... the elite who will be appointed as Prime Minister must be the only member of parliament with Khmer nationality" refers to Ensuring the sustainability of national institutions and the modernization of the Constitution, the flexibility and complexity of the new world geopolitics to protect national interests.
Therefore, this amendment is really necessary and most important for the national institutions to run smoothly, ensure sustainability in all circumstances for the benefit of our nation.
Mr. Rath Sandab continued that on the other hand, in terms of this amendment, it also reflects the values of the elite with real nationalist views and also reflects on the individuals with false nationalist views.
First, applauded this amendment with the Cambodian nation, both inside and outside the country, as a national heritage to make the top institutions of the nation run smoothly to serve our beautiful homeland.
Second, this celebration is to maintain the protection of peace, social and political stability at all times, regardless of the circumstances, including changes in the new political geography of the world. . These values have nurtured Cambodia as a land of the rule of law, democracy, liberal pluralism, free market system, and preserved the beautiful culture and traditions of our nation, both now and in the future.
* About a person with a false nationalism:
First, a small number of individuals who have a tendency to oppose their own society are dissatisfied with the amendment of the Constitution, because they have lost the opportunity to cover up the dirty tricks of serving foreigners, such as Sam Rainsy, who signed an agreement with Illegal crossing four provinces in northeastern Cambodia: Ratanakiri, Mondulkiri, Kratie and Stung Treng with Kok Sar, a Vietnamese Montagnard.
Second, these opposition-prone individuals could not sleep, seeing the country live in peace and tranquility, which caused them to lose the opportunity to seize power for themselves and their party.
These pseudo-nationalists are inciting people to pollute society, obstruct and push the country into war or color revolution, which often incites some activists to revolt. This country or imitate that country does not stop and so on. Therefore, the 10th amendment to the Constitution is to close the pages of history on leaders with false nationalism.
