On that occasion, President Thong Khon disseminated the implementation direction of the Cambodian People's Party to the meeting, including the following:
1. Continue to educate the public and encourage them to get vaccinated against Kovid 19, both at the basic dose and at the recommended dose for everyone. Continue to raise the movement by helping to solve the difficulties, challenges and requests of the people in the villages and communes.
2. Continue to strengthen security, public order, social security and political security at all levels to create a better domestic environment. Further promote the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes, strive to prevent and suppress all kinds of illegal activities that affect the psychology of the people.
3. Continue to educate party members and the public about achievements in all areas, about the success of the national Kovid vaccination campaign 19, about the policies, policies and measures of the party and the government to strengthen faith in the leadership of the party and the government.
4. Continue to strengthen party oversight at all levels to improve the leadership of party committees at all levels, especially at the commune level.
5. Continuing and promoting the work of the mass movement at all levels, especially at the district and commune levels, must work together to solve all local challenges, if necessary, ask for higher intervention to help solve. Continue to expand the ranks of the party's youth activists in all areas and strengthen the ranks of young officials for the next shift.
6. Continue to update the list of party members by family, group, sub-branch and party branch in all villages and communes before the 2023 election. Increase the education of officials at all levels in terms of views, positions and attitudes, morals, working methods, appropriate living habits, and gain the love of the people.
7. Continue to build and expand new members, especially give priority to youth and women, strengthen the control of party members in terms of both quantity and quality in the direction of "one member voting for one party" and continue to attract other party members to join the CPP. More.
