Dr. Kin Phea's Perspectives on the Presence of US, Chinese and Russian Foreign Ministers at the 55th ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and Related Meetings in Cambodia
According to a press release from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Cambodia, as the chair of ASEAN, has begun hosting the 55th ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and related meetings within the ASEAN framework from July 29 to 5. August 2022 in Phnom Penh.
Speaking to Fresh News on July 30, 2022, Kin Phea said that the presence of these foreign ministers shows that they are focused on ASEAN and that it is an opportunity for these countries to raise relevant issues. And its interests in this meeting as well.
Regarding Cambodia, Dr. Kin Phea added that the United States, China and Russia, more or less, really value ASEAN and value Cambodia as the chair of ASEAN because the presence of these foreign ministers underscores the value of the organization. Cambodia as the chair of ASEAN is increasingly recognized and also recognizes Cambodia's role in regional and global affairs.
"Overall, to Cambodia and to ASEAN as a whole, I think the presence of the US Secretary of State and the presence of other ASEAN dialogue partners, it highlights the values and importance of ASEAN in general, the values and importance of Cambodia in particular." . According to Dr. Kin Phea.
Dr. Kin Phea was also very interested in the US Secretary of State's upcoming visit to Cambodia, as he was absent from such an important meeting last year in Brunei. The US Secretary of State then made the ASEAN Secretary of State wait 45 minutes before confirming that he had not attended the meeting online due to internet issues.
Dr. Kin Phea said that this year, if the United States does not come on this occasion, it seems that the United States will provide a forum or provide a venue for other powers that are ASEAN partners to use alone, especially China and Russia may use this forum. To defend its agenda.
Luy David, Secretary of State at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation and Chairman of the Secretariat of the National Commission for Organizing the ASEAN Summit and Related Meetings 2022, told Fresh News that Cambodia is ready to host the ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting. 55th and related meetings are waiting for delegates to attend.
