Kandal Provincial Court Detains 5 Robbers on 3 Crimes
(Kandal): The five robbers who were arrested recently were charged with three offenses by the Kandal Provincial Court and sentenced to prison. This is according to Mr. So Sarin, spokesman for Kandal Provincial Court, told Fresh News Agency in Kandal province on July 29, 2022.
Mr. So Sarin further stated that the case was charged with three offenses, including: 1. The crime of aggravated assault due to the use of weapons and illegal use of drugs, charges against Thoeun Lin. , Second: aggravated theft charges against Borey Kimham and Long Chanborith, and third: aggravated theft charges against Khon Soeng Hak and Ny Soklai.
Please be reminded that on July 27, 2022, the specialized force of Kandal Provincial Police in cooperation with the Meanchey District Police Force of Phnom Penh cracked down on aggravated theft (motorcycle robbery) and arrested 5 suspects. .
All five are currently being held in Kandal Provincial Prison.
