(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Ly Taing Huy, 31 years old, resident of Chong Kaosou Village, Slor Kram Commune, Siem Reap District, Siem Reap Province, on July 28, 2022, publicly confessed his guilt in front of the Customs Officer of the Research Office. And cracked down on smuggling in Area 6, claiming that he had indeed provided false information to ABC Radio by publicly announcing that Customs in Area 6 demanded 6 million riel in compensation for his car in the case of his car carrying scrap metal.
It should be noted that on July 25, 2022 at 10:30, Customs officers from the Office of Investigation and Suppression of Smuggling Area 6 arrested a yellow Samsung car with license plate Phnom Penh 2AB: 5361 for stealing imported goods. From Vietnam through the corridor in Tbong Khmum province, in terms of taxes and fines equal to more than 10 million riels. At 17:34 on July 27, 2022, ABC Radio broadcast the news as described above.
This case is different from the fact that it seriously damaged the honor of the customs unit, so the customs officer summoned the owner to come and explain. After the car owner confessed and publicly apologized, the customs officer allowed the owner to return home, while the car and the illegal goods were temporarily stored by the customs and waited to follow the legal procedures.
