In particular, during the Tree Festival on July 9, 2022, palm trees were planted on both sides of the Cambodia-Vietnam border road, 10 km long, 4 meters apart, equal to 5,000 palm seedlings and 1 teal tree. 000 trees for distribution to government units, schools, pagodas and people as well.
