Eang Sophalleth, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's personal assistant, told reporters after the meeting that during the meeting, Mr. Kay Numa briefed Samdech Techo on the company's progress over the past 10 years. The company currently has a total investment of 1,124 billion yen ($ 8 billion) in 95 locations worldwide.
