Speaking at a press conference on "Achievements of the Ministry of Commerce for 5 years" on July 21, 2022, Mr. Pen Sovichet, Undersecretary of State and spokesman for the Ministry of Commerce, stated that "If the price of rice increases, please "Do not be afraid, the Ministry of Commerce and Green Trade have already been able to intervene in the market for rice prices."
Mr. Pen Sovichet said that during Kovid-19, when there was a red zone, the Ministry of Commerce immediately intervened by going to the location of the red zone and arranging sales on the spot to distribute to people with budgets. But can not go out to buy.
