The ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Long Sovann, Chairman of Preah Vihear Provincial Council, Mr. Prak Sovann, Provincial Governor, and attended by Mr. Peng Trida, Director of the Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, as well as municipal authorities, civil servants, armed forces. 3 Teachers, students and many other people.
