Sister stabbed her brother to death with seven knives when she was sent to the hospital, then the family secretly buried the body to hide the information
(Phnom Penh): A Khmer Muslim family secretly buried the body of a man quietly without letting the authorities know any information after he died because his sister stabbed him several times.
However, the secret was still leaked to the authorities and led to the arrest of a woman who is the sister of the body to take for questioning. This incident caused a great surprise at 12:30 noon on July 18, 2022, located at 1395 along National Road 5, Group 7, Village D, Sangkat Chrang Chamres II, Khan Russey Keo. .
Colonel Heang Tharet continued that on the day of the above day, the victim gave the neural medicine to his sister, but she refused to swallow and had an argument with his brother at that time. The younger sister, who was angry, took a sharp knife from the house and stabbed her brother in the back with seven knives, causing serious injuries. Her family sent her to the hospital. Calmette doctor for emergency care.
On July 18, 2022, at 12:30 AM, the victim died at Calmette Hospital. The victim's family later transported the victim's body back from the hospital to prepare for a traditional Islamic ceremony without reporting it to authorities.
It was not until 12:30 noon that Colonel Heang Tharet, District Inspector, received the above information and assigned the police force of Chrang Chamres 2 Administrative Police Station to arrest his sister, who was the perpetrator. Up to the channel to make inquiries.
