Social Security Regulator Holds Workshop to Conclude Draft Sub-Decree on Guidelines for Social Security Fund Investment
(Phnom Penh): The Social Security Regulator under the auspices of the Non-Banking Financial Services Authority on Monday, July 18, 2022, organized a workshop to review the contents of the draft sub-decree. On "Guidelines for Investing in Social Security Funds".
