(Kratie): A joint force led by Mr. Buoy Ratana, Chief of Prek Prasop Forestry Administration, under the coordination of Mr. Rabo Randy, Deputy Prosecutor of the Provincial Court, cracked down on many cubic meters of sawn timber and No. 1 timber without permission. From the Forestry Administration.
