(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ley Sopheap, President of the Association of Land Development and Construction Federation of Cambodia, on the afternoon of July 16, 2022, announced the addition of 445 new members and made good recommendations along with the main principles. 5 points for new and old members to continue to practice consistently.
On that occasion, the President of the Association set out 5 main principles for members to apply simultaneously, including:
1. Must meet to discuss how to set the working regime and to properly implement the work and business of their group in the field of land development and construction.
2. Continue to build human resources to understand the work in the field of land development and construction, especially the understanding of laws and regulations related to the field of land development and construction.
3. Build a reputation for people and stakeholders to have confidence and support for work in the field of land development and construction, as well as to provide mutual benefits to all stakeholders.
4. There must be internal unity within the group within the Cambodian Land Development and Construction Association.
5. Members of the Cambodian Land and Construction Development Association, as well as practitioners in the field of land development and construction in Cambodia, must comply with the law in accordance with the guidelines of the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister.
He also called on members of the Cambodian Land and Construction Development Association to increase cooperation with local authorities to better serve the nation and its people.
Mr. Ley Sopheap encouraged the members to work hard and work in their local area to expand the progress for the nation.
He advised the old and new members of the Association of the Land Development and Construction Federation of Cambodia to work according to the assigned structure to be fruitful in the work of the land development and construction sector.
