The Director General of the Cambodian Insurance Regulator said that the Cambodian insurance market will have great potential for future growth.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Bou Chanphirou, Director General of the Cambodian Insurance Regulator, said that the Cambodian insurance market will have great potential for future growth.
He said that in order to make this sector better, the transfer of knowledge to the public is important and journalists are an important party in bringing knowledge of the Cambodian insurance market to the public.
Mr. Bou Chanphiru's speech was made on July 15, 2022 at a seminar on sharing knowledge to the media about the operation of the insurance market in Cambodia, with the participation of Mr. Huy Vatharo, President of the Insurance Association Cambodia, as well as many journalists.
"The Cambodian insurance market will have great potential for future growth," said Bou Chanphiro. The use of the insurance sector in Cambodia is still low due to the low public awareness, so the mainstreaming of knowledge and benefits of insurance services is a key factor in driving growth in the use of insurance services more widely as in developed countries. In the universe.
He added that journalists have a very important role to play as a bridge to share knowledge about the insurance market to the general public and on behalf of the Cambodian regulators would like to thank the journalists who understand their main role and take the time to participate. In today's workshop to contribute to the development of the insurance sector in Cambodia.
He stressed that in order for journalists to be able to fill out their information effectively, journalists need to have a clear knowledge of insurance services, such as understanding the benefits of insurance services, insurance products, insurance market processes and regulations related to insurance. And so on.
Huy Vataro said that insurance services are especially recognized in the developed countries of the world because they are a financial safety net that helps you and your loved ones. In Cambodia, the use of this service is still low due to lack of knowledge about the use of insurance services.
He added that in order to raise awareness of insurance services, the Cambodian Insurance Regulator, the Insurance Association of Cambodia has developed a practical situation in education, promotion and general situation of Cambodian insurance services. In order for the sector to be more widely disseminated to the general public through the media, it is necessary and most important.
He stressed that the mainstreaming of knowledge through training seminars to share knowledge to journalists about the operation of the insurance market in Cambodia has provided a lot of knowledge about the insurance sector in Cambodia to journalists, so hopefully after this workshop Journalists will have a deeper knowledge of the insurance industry.
Please be informed that insurance is a means used to prevent serious financial hardship caused by risk or can be interpreted as a legal contract that specifies the terms of transfer and risk between the purchaser or the insured and the company. Insurance. Driving, please do not violate the speed limit! 4 killed and 13 injured in traffic accidents nationwide on July 15
