According to Dr. Sok Touch, history has clearly taught Cambodia about the consequences of Cambodian politicians pursuing a policy in favor of one superpower and facing other powers, leading Cambodia into crisis for decades. Years ago.
Dr. Sok Touch cited as an example that when France colonized before leaving, France ceded Kampuchea Krom in 1949 to Vietnam, and when Cambodia was loyal to China in 1975, Cambodia received nothing but No ideology. In the context of this new world, politics, colorful flowers are the best choice of small countries like Cambodia, especially in the face of competition for influence between world powers.
However, Dr. Sok Touch claimed that for Cambodia in the current context, the Royal Government has used colorful policies in relations with the world powers because Cambodia needs to develop countries and markets for its exports.
In addition, Dr. Sok Touch also mentioned an event that confirms the kindness of Cambodia that opens its heart to all friendly nations in the world, especially the United States is the declaration of acceptance. Journeys aboard the Western Dam, which is denied entry by many countries and territories.
At this point, the President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia stressed: "If Cambodia were to go to China, the Cambodian leaders would not be able to openly accept the passengers on board because the whole world is worried about the crisis. Outbreak of Kovid 19.
Expressing this painful feeling during the invitation to be a speaker in the roundtable discussion on "ASEAN between China and the United States" on July 14, 2022.
