Dr. Sok Touch emphasized that Cambodia does not lack raw materials for the production of products for export to foreign markets, but must become a country of modern industrial products for export so that foreigners know Cambodia better.
At the same time, Dr. Sok Touch continued that in Cambodia, there are a lot of raw materials for the production of finished products for export to foreign markets, these are opportunities for Cambodia, so if Cambodia continues to lead agricultural products in a row to export. Other countries will make Cambodia lose a lot.
