Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong stated, "My wife and I are deeply saddened and deeply saddened to learn of the death of His Excellency Ing Kiet, Personal Adviser to the King, who is the husband of the deceased. Wednesday, the 15th day of the month of Asat, the year of Karl Chatva Sak, BE 2566, corresponds to July 13, 2022, at the age of 98 years old due to old age.
I would like to express my deepest condolences and condolences to Lok Chumteav and the families of all those who have lost their husbands, fathers, fathers-in-law, grandfathers and great-grandfathers. An outstanding figure who has struggled to dedicate his physical and mental resources to contribute to the development of the nation in the past.
Once again, my wife and I would like to pray for the soul of His Excellency Ing Kiet to be happy in hell forever.
As the chair of ASEAN in 2022, Cambodia sees the increasingly important role of the BRICS countries in addressing regional and global challenges.
(Phnom Penh): As the rotating chair of ASEAN in 2022, Cambodia hopes that ASEAN will cooperate with the BRICS countries to jointly address regional and global challenges, especially post-pandemic recovery.
Responding to a recent question from the Cambodia-China Friendship Radio of Central China Radio and Television, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, said that since the establishment of the BRICS countries, they Always focused on development, innovation, technology and practical cooperation.
Over the past decade, the BRICS countries have become increasingly influential on the international stage. In the face of the pandemic challenges of this century, the BRICS countries have played an increasingly important role, with BRICS countries being the driving force for social and economic recovery after the pandemic, as well as the main driving force for peace, prosperity and prosperity. Diversify the world.
Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon believes that the promotion of BRICS cooperation, especially the promotion of BRICS + cooperation, reflects the spirit of multilateralism, can effectively respond to the challenges of the times and will enable the BRICS countries to represent The sound of the growing market is getting better.
Overall, as the rotating chair of ASEAN in 2022, Cambodia hopes that ASEAN will work with the BRICS and other members of the international community to jointly address regional and global challenges, especially post-food security outbreaks. And energy to achieve 2030 under the agenda for sustainable development and provide new impetus, this is the additional emphasis of HE Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon.
According to the keynote address in this important dialogue, Samdech focused on key issues, including: economic recovery after the Kovid-19 crisis, continued pressure on the global security environment, food security and the importance of multilateralism and cooperation. International transactions based on legal rules.
