The Ministry of Tourism is preparing a package tour to various destinations through special discount travel tickets for people
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism has been preparing tour packages for people and tourists in groups to travel to various tourist destinations across the country through the implementation of the "tour card" to contribute to the promotion of local tourism. In and receive international tourists.
Mr. Chuon Chey Satya, Director of the Department of Local Tourism Promotion of the Ministry of Tourism, confirmed that the "Travel Card" is a consumer identification card with a local package already included, which includes food travel services. Admission (if any) and accommodation services. Those who have the right to use the card are the general public, but this card is valid for one year.
Mr. Chuon Chey Satya continued that tour tickets can only be used at tourism facilities that are members of the network of tour operators that use the tour card system in Cambodia, including restaurants, restaurants, accommodation services and tour transport without Excludes products or services other than tourism.
The director of the department further explained that the launch of the tour card is organized in three stages as follows:
* Phase 1: The Ministry of Tourism, through the Department of Local Tourism Promotion, will educate the public with the facilitator to launch the tour ticket, which is free of charge for the first year. Mr. Chuon Chey Satya confirmed that the Ministry of Tourism is currently distributing free travel tickets to the people.
* Stage 3: Users can seek to purchase this tour ticket from the coordinating and implementing institution that is officially recognized by the Ministry of Tourism or through the institution-institution or through its institution. This tour will include ticket prices, resorts and other major tourist destinations (National Museum, Royal Palace ...).
He gave the example, "If the normal price is one package, the price is $ 69, but when the Ministry cooperates with partners through the tour card, the price is only $ 39 for one night and one day to sleep in a high standard resort. "Including food, accommodation, travel is all covered."
He added that the Ministry of Tourism will set up a sticker or display at tourism businesses that are partners through this tour card to make it easier for tourists to see or know that they will receive a discount from each store. That through a travel voucher.
It should be informed that in the past, there were more than 300 tour operators in cooperation with the Ministry of Tourism, such as 66 in Phnom Penh, 76 in Sihanoukville, 166 in Siem Reap, but due to these 19 crises There is a change because some businesses are closed or temporarily suspended.
