(Beijing): The foundation of a river lies in its source, while the future of a country lies in its youth. Youth is the most positive and vibrant force in the whole society, youth is the hope of the nation and also the future of the nation. Chinese youth are the leading force in achieving the great prosperity of the Chinese nation forever.
It should be noted that the young people in the new era of China are full of enthusiasm, vitality, duty and responsibility in the major engineering process that reflects the national strength and spreads the will to respond to public emergencies. At a critical juncture in the face of death, they have not given up and have been keeping their promises to the country and its people through their practical application.
Society is an important class for the growth and development of young people. Young Chinese in the new era adhere to a more self-confident attitude and a more self-reliant spirit to adapt to society, integrate with society, as well as participate in the development process of society and become initiators and The practice of positive force.
As of 2021, 470,000 young people have been actively involved in providing support for education, agriculture and health in the local area, while millions of young students have been involved in all kinds of social activities to fulfill their responsibilities. A new impetus for the campaign to overcome obstacles to eradicate poverty and promote rural prosperity.
Chinese youth in the new era show to the world imagination and productive force, liberate ideas and pioneer and seek progress, as well as dare to participate in the increasingly intense international competition. Benefiting from the good policies of the party and the state, they have become a living force for innovation and career creation in all fields such as economy, society, technology and culture.
It should be recalled that since the 18th CPC National Congress, the Chinese youth in the new era have considered the restoration of the great prosperity of the Chinese nation as a personal task and have shown a spirit of self-confidence and perseverance. Independently, the owner has received close attention and admiration from the international community.
