Dr. AK Abdul Mo's visit to Cambodia will reaffirm the two countries' commitment to further enhance the existing good relations and cooperation for the mutual benefit of the two nations. Two.
The Constitutional Council told the King that the draft constitution on the amendment of the eight articles of the Constitution and the Constitution could not affect the democratic system.
The meeting was chaired by Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council at the White House of Chamkarmon.
Dr. Prohm Vichet Akhra added that members of the Constitutional Council had told the King that the initiative to amend the Constitution would not affect liberal democracy, pluralism and constitutional monarchy. When the nation is not in an emergency.
He added that the decision of the Constitutional Council is based on the new Article 153, the new Article 154 and the new Article 155 of the Constitution.
Please be informed that the draft Constitution on the amendment of the eight articles of the Constitution and the Constitution was reviewed and approved by the Plenary Session of the Council of Ministers on July 08, 2022.
It should be noted that the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, which was promulgated on September 24, 1993, has been amended 10 times, including now. This amendment aims to ensure national sustainability as well as the national interests and the people of Cambodia.
The details of these eight amendments have not yet been confirmed. The Council of Ministers has confirmed that the Minister of Justice, Mr. Keut Rith, will hold a press conference to confirm the amendment.
