Imports from the United States to Cambodia amounted to 168 million US dollars, an increase of 8.7 percent compared to the same period in 2021 amounted to 154 million US dollars.
The increase in Cambodia's exports to the United States underscores the improvement in trade between Cambodia and the United States. The United States is the number one export market and an important market for Cambodia.
Speaking to Fresh News on July 12, 2022, Oknha Lim Heng, Vice President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, said that the volume of Cambodian-US trade has increased significantly in recent years due to leadership factors. The Royal Government successfully managed the Kovid issue, leaving the factory production line unhindered.
Tycoon Lim Heng stated that "the volume of Cambodian-US trade has seen an increase from year to year, especially in recent years due to the leadership of the Royal Government to control and "The success of Kovid reopens the market, making the production chain of factories invested in Cambodia unhindered."
Tycoon Lim Heng said that the Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement is in progress, which makes the flow of raw materials and equipment that Cambodia needs to develop the country more rich and export to Lower America. GSP preferential line.
The tycoon said that while some countries were facing problems with the Kovid and the political crisis, the chain was blocked, and market orders from all those countries turned to Cambodia, which led some factories to invest in Cambodia. More to bring to America.
At the same time, he believes that companies from the United States and other countries will come to invest in Cambodia while Cambodia is implementing the Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement, which is duty-free to China.
He noted that in recent years, Cambodia-US trade relations have grown significantly:
* In 2016, Cambodia-US trade volume seemed to decrease slightly to $ 2.320 million, but Cambodia's exports to the United States continued to increase, reaching $ 2.147 billion, while the United States re-imported into Cambodia only Only $ 173 million.
* In 2019, the trade volume between Cambodia and the United States was more than 4,713 million US dollars, of which Cambodia exported 4,402 million US dollars, while the United States imported only more than 311 million US dollars.
