(Preah Sihanouk): Tycoon Tea Vichet, President of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Maritime Transport Association, donated 4 million Riel to a poor family, a family of crab fishermen, who suffered a shipwreck accident that completely sank the boat. Around Koh Preap Dam on the afternoon of July 10, 2022.
After receiving the above information and seeing the hardships of life and sympathy for the families of the victims, Tycoon Tea Vichet on July 11, 2022, immediately sent a team to meet and bring money. 4 million Riels of Mr. Oknha directly to support the family fishing business.
It should be noted that the victim's family has a husband named Bo Chantha, 52 years old, and a wife named Chou Theng, 42 years old, living in a rented room at Rolok Dam, Group 31, Village 3, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville.
According to the victim, before the incident, her husband took out his boat as a small fishing boat with crab nets as usual, but this time the sea was very windy. His waves hit the dam rocks near the shores of Koh Preap, causing complete damage to the boat. He jumped out of the boat and swam to safety.
