To His Majesty the Prince of Life on the Rock, the highest reverence, He consulted with the Constitutional Council in the message dated 08 July 2022 on the draft Constitution on the proposed amendment to Article 19 (a). 89 new 98 articles, 102 new articles, 119 new articles (a) and 125 new articles of the Constitution, and 3 new articles and 4 new articles of the Constitution, in addition to ensuring the normal functioning of national institutions.
According to a press release obtained by Fresh News on July 11, 2022, the meeting will be chaired by Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council, at the Chamkar Mon State Palace.
Please be informed that the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, promulgated on September 24, 1993, has been amended nine times in a row in order to ensure national sustainability as well as national interests and Cambodian people.
This draft Constitution is the 10th amendment proposal of the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, which is designed to amend eight articles, including six articles of the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, including 19 new articles (one) and 89 articles. Article 98, Article 102 (new), Article 119 (one) and Article (125) and the additional Constitution to ensure the normal functioning of two national institutions, Article 3 (new) and Article 4 (new).
