Dissemination Workshop on the Official Launch of the Digital Agriculture Business Acceleration Program
The purpose of this workshop is to promote and officially launch the Digital Agriculture Business Acceleration Program to the public, the public and other stakeholders working in agriculture, agribusiness, new business or existing digital nurseries, but still lacking. Supporters of both resources and techniques may be eligible to apply for digital agribusiness acceleration funding to seek further innovation.
In addition, the workshop shared knowledge, experience and two main presentations, the first topic was about the activities of Sub-component 2.2 and the second topic was the program to accelerate digital agribusiness as well as Discuss the possibility of applying for this fund as well, and potential candidates will be selected to participate in this program as well.
Representatives from IFAD key stakeholders, as well as agribusiness, agribusiness and financial institutions that have been using digital technology to address agricultural challenges, are invited to attend the workshop.
As a result, participants not only participated in fruitful debates, but also received information on how to apply for the Digital Agribusiness Acceleration Program to win business awards, as well as gain a better understanding of the benefits of The process of technological innovation, which is important in reducing poverty by providing economic opportunities to the rural population.
