The Department of Health always operates in all districts of Kampong Speu province and focuses on the main points such as: dissemination of dengue fever, prevention and eradication of mosquitoes, suspected cases to send patients to the nearest health center, placement Albatrite kills worms in pool water, spraying mosquito repellent at schools, health centers, people's homes (no water, no worms, no tiger mosquitoes, no dengue, healthy family).
