Ms. Mean Sam An continued that in order to end the TB epidemic in Cambodia by the end of 2035, in line with the vision of a TB-free Cambodia in accordance with the Strategic Plan 2021-2030 and in line with the Sustainable Development Goals (SDG), National Development Plan 2019. 2023 With the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 in implementing the priority policies of the Royal Government, in which the health sector is an important priority, which also includes TB.
Starting from the above points, Cambodia is in the process of making good progress in achieving the set goals as well as its commitment at the UN Summit on Tuberculosis (UNHLM-TB) in 2018 in New York City.
