* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not important to win a gold, silver or bronze medal, but what is important is to respect the rules of respecting the rules of the competition without using drugs that lead to damage to honor The whole of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen decides to provide a special flight to transport the Cambodian Paralympic delegation to Indonesia.
