* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to save electricity. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the investment in electricity reached a loss, but the Royal Government did not increase the price to reduce the cost of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) will lose about $ 100 million in 2022 due to the war crisis and sanctions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the policy of sanctions should be considered.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the loss of investment in electricity due to rising fuel prices.
