(Phnom Penh): In response to the call of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Oknha Dr. Huy Phieu and Lok Chumteav donated $ 2,000 to the Royal Government of Cambodia to solve mine problems throughout Cambodia.
